ssifier text is absent.\n\n**Tests at this head:** `hash_chain` 28, `audit_bundle` 24, `audit_command` 7, `audit_export` 18, `audit_schema` 7, `flight_exclude` 8, `trace_transparency` 14, `leak_guard` 6, `protocol_parity` 5, `protocol_schema` 8, all passing; `flight_sanitization` 2 of 3.\n\n**Not checked:** a byte-flip probe separate from the existing tamper tests (which pass), an older verifier on a new bundle, a signed bundle, Node 22.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"fd65daa9-0bd5-4349-9d77-0cb3e3835154","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
