{"type":"data-flow-records","v":1,"sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","records":[{"response_id":"msg_011ChMKFxUrS7xKXUBSuzdKQ","mark_sent_by":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","listed":["msg_011ChMKFERmk6pnRxGpP8JJ8"]}]}
{"parentUuid":"822b99e8-01de-44ca-a564-9b74bd32d593","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMKFxUrS7xKXUBSuzdKQ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Measured results for #771 at Codex's newest head (`3600eefd`) are posted on the PR, and it is still request changes.\n\n- **What Codex's commit fixed:** the file-system monitor no longer runs during an audit export.\n- **What still executes:** all four filter configurations I planted (a clean filter, a filter named only in `.git/info/attributes`, a filter defined in an included file, and an attributes file named by the repository). Each ran its planted command during the real export.\n- **With #772 on top:** none of them run, the binding reports \"unavailable\", and all six related test files pass.\n\nTwo corrections to my own #772, both now pushed:\n\n- **Its first test was partly vacuous.** I changed the tracked file's size, and git then knows a file is modified without reading it, so the filter cases passed without ever triggering a filter. The test now keeps the content and bumps the modification time. With my check disabled it fails because the clean filter's command actually runs.\n- **One fixture was broken.** The included-file case's command was cut off at an unquoted semicolon, so that case could never have run. It's quoted now.\n\nSo #772's earlier \"five planted configurations\" claim was stronger than what the test showed at the time; it is accurate as of the current head (`fa919263`).\n\n#771 and #772 are both open and waiting on Codex. The release branch is unchanged and green at `5abbc4cb`."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":422,"cache_read_input_tokens":728752,"output_tokens":448,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation"