{"parentUuid":"3fe62ce5-40ce-4924-86b3-4379f4c0ab85","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMUJiGiSi6HAAq7qNwdt","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The first review of #772 produced nothing usable: the reviewer ran out of time before running a single hostile configuration, so it gave no verdict. That means #772 is on the release branch without an independent review, and I can't yet tell you whether it has a bypass.\n\nI've started a tighter, time-boxed probe against the current release tip to settle that. It is one test file with seventeen cases: the nine configurations that executed before, several new ones (per-worktree config, key-case variants, an attempt to confuse the scope parsing, a plain hook file, a registered submodule), and three controls for normal repositories and an operator's own global filter. Each case runs with the check enabled and again with it disabled, so the result shows both whether anything gets through and whether each case really triggers.\n\nIf any planted program runs with the check enabled, I'll open a follow-up fix. The release branch is at `4ae25a10`, CI green, with no open PRs."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3762,"cache_read_input_tokens":746132,"output_tokens":295,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3762,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":295,"cache_read_input_tokens":746132,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3762,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3762},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"