ared service summary and the MCP tool's output are unchanged.\n\n## Not done\n\n- The shutdown bound mirrors `serve-mcp` (kill grace + 5 s) and does not cover the last stage of a kill at twice the grace.\n- Node 22 was not run locally.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n"}},"apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011ChMWuKyyVxpDJSr7EMk16","requestRef":"8c6d5479-8212-4384-927d-fcd8d8c6f25d","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"1be20e8d-cab6-4d19-a718-b79ffd97a3c2","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:28:34.998Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
