{"type":"data-flow-records","v":1,"sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","records":[{"response_id":"msg_011ChMXYXFAcCPD1sT42DVfo","mark_sent_by":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","listed":["msg_011ChMXYf9fvt1DF37KKFAH9"]},{"response_id":"msg_011ChMXYuWNj3pzcLuGar6pe","mark_sent_by":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b"}]}
{"parentUuid":"b3559238-09c8-4ad4-8f5b-15121ec478fb","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMXYXFAcCPD1sT42DVfo","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The plan for the remaining five units is written, and two more build tracks have started. Five units are now being built in parallel, each in its own worktree under its own claim.\n\n**Building now**\n- GV-1 slices 3–4 with the GV-5 allowlists\n- BG-1 (detached, resumable runs)\n- HK-1 (pre-tool and post-tool hooks)\n- PF-4 (library entry point)\n- SB-1 (named permission profiles)\n\n**In review**\n- #777, the six VR-2 follow-ups (mine)\n- #774 and #775, from the other session\n\n**Queued behind these:** PA-2 slice 1, MT-2's characterization tests, then BG-2, HK-2, HK-3 and PF-3. MT-2's dispatch split goes last, because it rewrites files everything else touches.\n\n**Decisions from the third plan that you may want to overrule**\n- **PF-4:** the package stays unpublished (D13's default). The library only drives the sidecar as a separate process, so an embedder can't skip start-up checks, and its client API can't express \"allow always\".\n- **PF-3:** a unix socket only, with no TCP or HTTP listener. One controlling client and any number of read-only observers; only the controller answers approvals.\n- **SB-1:** three profiles, selected through the existing `--sandbox` flag. With no profile given, behaviour is unchanged.\n- **PA-2:** after each merge of a parallel unit, every already-integrated verifier is re-run along with the operator's. A unit that edits another unit's test files is refused.\n- **MT-2:** the complexity baseline moves forward once, after the last slice. The plan asks for your acknowledgement before that happens.\n\nThe release branch is at `bd0cd1c2`, CI green."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1530,"cache_read_input_tokens":830472,"output_tokens":578,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1530,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":578,"cache_read_input_tokens":830472,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1530,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1530},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChMXYX1nZibwDKEwmiFMi","requestRef":"9f47d45e-d4e0-423e-84fe-f01e3a8b3acb","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"32dc310c-7fc3-4d40-ac01-68b6dfc40fe2","timestamp":"2026-11-24T09:36:51.950Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
