chema | 18 | 0 |\n| operation_runner_restart | 1 | 0 |\n\n**Not checked**\n- Neither PR was run on Node 22 and 24.\n- I did not run the full suites.\n- For #774, I did not check the plan doc text beyond its first line, or the `taskActiveSinceMs` write ordering under real kills.\n- I did not run the failing #774 test on the base worktree.\n- I did not review #775's new head commit.\n\nI removed both worktrees at the end. They were first created at the wrong commit by a shell slip, and I re-checked them out to the exact SHAs before reviewing.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>71553</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>30</tool_uses><duration_ms>1044971</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}]}}
