{"parentUuid":"ab16f317-2cfc-4cdd-a94f-77fbf3ace035","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMbYvHUxdmjg1fa2Uq5g","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_018xT99jGwSYDLb6pwspYjMW","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd ~/nexus-wt/gv1c && git fetch -q origin && git status --short | wc -l && git add -A cli docs && git commit -q -m \"feat(policy): enforce MCP and plugin allowlists, close the always-approve gap, add nexus policy (GV-1 slices 3-4, GV-5)\n\nGV-5: mcp.allow, mcp.disable_workspace, plugins.allow and\nplugins.disable_workspace were accepted and enforced nothing. A server\noutside the allowlist is not started and a plugin outside it is not loaded;\ndisable_workspace ignores workspace-level definitions, by path or by symlink\ntarget. Refusals name the policy source. An unreadable policy admits nothing.\n\nGV-1 slice 3: under approval.disable_auto or strict, an 'always' answer\napproves the one call and is not remembered, in the sidecar and in the REPL\n(whose own mode copy used to stop asking), and /mode auto reports the\nrefusal. nexus verify refuses --yes, --sandbox none and --sandbox-network\nwhen policy forbids them.\n\nGV-1 slice 4: nexus policy show and nexus policy check [file], both with\n--json and exit 2 on an invalid policy; doctor findings for each policy\ntier and the effective policy; doctor --fix never touches a policy file.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\" && git merge origin/release/v1.3.0 --no-edit 2>&1 | tail -4; git diff --name-only --diff-filter=U","description":"Commit the GV work and merge the release branch into it"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1121,"cache_read_input_tokens":861958,"output_tokens":764,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":99},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_re