e 2 and slice 3 states.\n\n## Left\n\nThe other seven events, HK-2 and HK-3. `docs/releases/v1.3.0-READINESS.md` still lists HK-1 as open. The branch is 8 commits behind `origin/release/v1.3.0`.\n\n## Release note\n\n- Two events only: `pre-tool` and `post-tool`.\n- Hooks are unsandboxed.\n- An invalid `~/.config/nexus/hooks.json` denies every tool call.\n- Non-zero exits other than 2 deny, unlike Claude Code.\n- The approval prompt comes before hooks.\n- `serve-mcp` runs no hooks.\n- Project hooks are not a control over the agent, which can edit the file and so stop them.</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>451017</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>154</tool_uses><duration_ms>4865998</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"},"uuid":"9d03cc1b-d84e-4973-8e0e-e336b90de79f","timestamp":"2026-11-24T10:54:41.494Z","permissionMode":"bypassPermissions","origin":{"kind":"task-notification","producer":"session-task","runId":"0mwuhyz4i-71efdcc5"},"promptSource":"system","turnOrigin":"task_notification","turnPromptId":"4a73be95-1a84-4ada-8252-ce77f36dc332","turnPosition":{"promptIndex":40,"turnIndex":265},"queueSkipAttachments":true,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
