{"parentUuid":"35f8769f-de2e-440d-9a94-d9b9086be94c","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-2","id":"msg_011ChMwTYTFUgD12mvMuJ5eK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Status at about 15:40Z, back at full speed after the usage pause.\n\n**Where each unit on your list stands**\n\n| Unit | State |\n|---|---|\n| VR-2 follow-ups | Done, merged (#777) |\n| GV-1 slices 3–4, GV-5 allowlists | Merged (#778); review follow-ups open as #783 |\n| HK-1 hooks | Built, all three slices; open as #782, in review |\n| PA-2 verified merges | Being built now |\n| SB-1 profiles | Codex took it over; first slice merged (#781) |\n| PF-4 library entry | Codex took it over; open as #779, green, my review running |\n| BG-1 detached runs | Codex took it over; open as #780, CI red |\n| MT-2, BG-2, HK-2, HK-3, PF-3 | Planned, not started |\n\n**What changed during the pause:** Codex took over BG-1, PF-4 and SB-1, working in the worktrees I had set up. I'm leaving those three to it and reviewing its PRs instead of duplicating them. I've asked it in the claims log to say so before starting any of the five units not yet started.\n\n**Review results since I resumed**\n- **#778 review** (posted after the fact; another session merged the PR before it reported): accept with follow-ups. The one real gap was that an allowlist entry naming a server let a workspace file redefine that name with its own program, and the program ran. #783 fixes it: a workspace-defined server is now admitted only by its program path or URL. That is a behaviour change for anyone who allowed a workspace server by name.\n- **#783** also stops `nexus policy check` from echoing file contents in its error messages.\n\n**One conflict coming:** #780 (Codex's BG-1) and #782 (my HK-1) both add the same two helper modules and both move code out of the verification service. Whichever merges second has to reconcile them. I've flagged this in the claims log and will do the reconciliation on #782 if #780 lands first.\n\n**Running now:** reviews of #782, #779 and #783, and the PA-2 build. The release branch is at `83413dc8`, CI green."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1470,"cache_read_input_tokens":935188,"output_tokens":701,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1470,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":701,"cache_read_input_tokens":935188,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1470,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1470},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011ChMwTYCdLR7rhjDdyd5dF","requestRef":"db356bc7-1707-43c8-ae58-3eea0ff05d01","requestedModel":"claude-fable-5-2","promptCacheRequested":"1h","type":"assistant","uuid":"34371971-e81e-4d9e-bba0-bbba198fc4f9","timestamp":"2026-11-24T14:50:29.751Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-2","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","madeBy":"model","session_id":"d25d0d24-8aed-4b03-a951-966dc54f0666","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/home/mike/nexus-code","sessionId":"43bcbb67-2cff-4fa8-a05e-f8aa598df73b","version":"2.1.329","gitBranch":"main","slug":"synthetic-moseying-seahorse","dataFlowOn":true}
